            "m_dialogTag": "Completion",
            "m_dialogEntries": [
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KM-GOBB-NPC17_B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "*Zzz* Huh? Wha- oh! Hi. Sorry, I've been auditing... factory equipment, but there's just so much to do and I keep... falling asleep standing up.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Gobbler_Mechanic_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_003|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/GobblerEngineer_003_04.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1487197,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KM-GOBB-NPC17_B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Is that food for me? GIMME! *nom nom nom* Mmm. I feel like a new Gobbler. Thanks! Oh yeah: the factory equipment.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Gobbler_Mechanic_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_003|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/GobblerEngineer_003_05.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1487197,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KM-GOBB-NPC17_B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "The equipment is rundown, but operable. The problem is our power source, the Fizzle Pebble Generator. She's kaput.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Gobbler_Mechanic_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_003|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/GobblerEngineer_003_06.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1487197,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KM-GOBB-NPC17_B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "I can bypass the broken elements, but we'll still need something to supply the kinetic energy. I was thinking Gobblers on Treadmills.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Gobbler_Mechanic_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_003|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/GobblerEngineer_003_07.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1487197,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KM-GOBB-NPC17_B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Not only will that provide the energy to run the Factory that's making healthy food, it gets Gobblers exercising and producing more Splendorphins!",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Gobbler_Mechanic_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_003|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/GobblerEngineer_003_08.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1487197,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KM-GOBB-NPC17_B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "I can round up the runners if you can procure the Treadmills. There should be plenty in the Gym the Witch, er, Rosina hangs out in. Good luck!",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Gobbler_Mechanic_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_003|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/GobblerEngineer_003_09.mp3",
